<title>USA: First Albany sets 5 pct stock dividend.</title>
<headline>First Albany sets 5 pct stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>ALBANY, N.Y. 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Albany Cos Inc said on Friday its board has approved a five percent stock dividend payable November 21, 1996 to shareholders of record on November 7, 1996.</p>
<p>The company has approximately 4.7 million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
